# alfa-ai consumer only (one-way coupling)

This repo is a **consumer** of the ALFa AI brain (`alfa-ai`). The brain owns LiteLLM
routing, pool27 orchestration, admin health, and cluster deploy conventions.

## Hard rules

1. **Never edit, commit to, vendor, or submodule `alfa-ai` from this repo.**
   If you need a brain change (new LiteLLM alias, model tier, orchestrator fix),
   stop and file that change in `alfa-ai` on its owning host, then wire this repo
   via **env only** (`LITELLM_BASE_URL`, model alias ids, `*_MODEL`).

2. **Chat widgets call this repo's own backend** (`/api/ai-narrative/*` or equivalent),
   never alfa-ai's `/alfa-ai/api/guest/chat` or `/alfa-ai/api/chat` directly.

3. **No cross-bot data.** This bot's chat must not read another consumer bot's database
   or API. See alfa-ai `docs/ALFA_AI_CHAT_WIDGETS.md` and chat-data-isolation policy.

4. **LiteLLM is stateless HTTP.** Do not assume server-side memory between requests.

## When blocked on brain behavior

Report the needed alfa-ai change (file, env var, or LiteLLM alias) and continue consumer
work only after the operator deploys the brain update.

